     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Steps to reproduce"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The exact test data is named below so that the result does not depend on which person is picked \u2014 the behaviour follows the person's location, not the person."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "orderedList",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Sign in as an Administrator and make sure the location selected at the top of the app is Staging Heavy Duty - 9919."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Go to Administration and open the Staff list."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Find "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Benjamin Peters",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "strong"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": ". His record belongs to the other location, "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Staging Lethbridge - 4310",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "strong"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": ", but he is listed here all the same."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Open his record with the edit (pencil) icon on his row."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Switch on "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Set custom hours for this technician",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "strong"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Now change the location at the top of the app to "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Staging Lethbridge - 4310",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "strong"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": ", open the same person again and switch the same toggle on."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "For a direct contrast in the same sitting, repeat steps 3 to 5 with "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Ayesha Khan AK",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": ", who belongs to Staging Heavy Duty - 9919. Her hours open normally, which shows the editor itself is working."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Expected behaviour"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Switching the toggle on should reveal the Monday-to-Sunday From/To editor and let the hours be set, for any staff member the Staff list offers."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The Schedule specification describes the technician working-hours editor without any condition about which location the person is being viewed from:"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "\"Set custom hours for this technician\" reveals a per-day (Mon-Sun) From/To editor for that technician.",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Governing requirement: Schedule specification, Confluence page 713031682, version 23, section 4.2 (Working Hours)."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "If the hours genuinely are meant to be per-location, then the expected behaviour is that the screen says so \u2014 either by not offering the toggle, or by telling the user which location they need to switch to. What should not happen is an error that reads as a fault."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Current behaviour"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "bulletList",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "The toggle flicks on and then immediately back to off, and this inline error appears: "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Couldn't load this technician's hours, so they can't be edited right now. Close and reopen the dialog to try again.",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "code"
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Closing and reopening the dialog, as the message suggests, makes no difference. It fails the same way every time."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "No editor is ever shown, so the hours cannot be set at all from this location."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Changing the location to Staging Lethbridge - 4310 and repeating the same steps on the same person "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "works immediately",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "strong"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": ": the editor appears and the hours can be edited."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Changing the location back to Staging Heavy Duty - 9919 brings the failure back."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Images"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "No screenshot is attached. The visible symptom is a single line of error text quoted above, and the underlying cause is a server response rather than anything visual, so the request and response are given in full below instead \u2014 they show the cause where a picture of the dialog could not."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Technical details for developers"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The dialog asks for the staff member's hours and is told the staff member does not exist:"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "GET /api/staff/11d2d65b-d8c5-48cf-b34b-382f039d2e12/working-hours",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "404  {\"errors\":[{\"error\":\"'Staff' was not found.\"}]}",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The same id, on a neighbouring call made by the same dialog moments earlier, is found without difficulty:"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "GET /api/staff/11d2d65b-d8c5-48cf-b34b-382f039d2e12/enrolled-workplaces",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "200  { ... \"name\":\"Staging Lethbridge - 4310\" ... }",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "So the record exists and the endpoint can see it; it is the working-hours lookup that appears to be filtered by the session's current workplace. Switching the session with "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "POST /api/iam/change-location",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " flips the result deterministically and reversibly:"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "bulletList",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "session on Heavy Duty - 9919: Benjamin Peters "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "404",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "code"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": ", Ayesha Khan AK "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "200",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "code"
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "session on Lethbridge - 4310: Benjamin Peters "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "200",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "code"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": ", Ayesha Khan AK "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "200",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "code"
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "session back on Heavy Duty - 9919: Benjamin Peters "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "404",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "code"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": " again"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Scope was measured rather than estimated. Every staff record in the list was probed on its "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "staff_id",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": ": "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "63 of 161 return 404 and 98 return 200",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": ". Technicians are the most affected group (34 of 54)."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "One note that may save time: this endpoint takes the "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "staff_id",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " field, which is a different value from the "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "id",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " field on the same row of the staff list (for Ayesha Khan AK, "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "id",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " is 24e7590c-7f44-4121-964f-af495c72e2f4 while "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "staff_id",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " is 1e81b8a0-9a45-4f16-89e3-209bf240990a). Probing with the wrong one returns the same 404 for everybody."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "A duplicate search was run before filing. Five queries were used: every descendant of epic SV-8685 (68 issues), and project-wide text searches for \"working hours\", \"custom hours\", summary \"hours\", and \"Staff was not found\". The nearest reports are all different faults:"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "bulletList",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "SV-8887, SV-8890, SV-8891 and SV-8892 are all about the hours editor once it is open - minute granularity, overlap colouring, row alignment and end-before-start validation. This report is about the editor never opening."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "SV-8851 is the Tech Hours display switch on the Schedule board."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "SV-8827 is about that switch's default state."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "SV-8831 and SV-8922 are the opposite direction - somebody appearing on the Schedule grid who has no staff record for the location."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 }
}